(text "USB2 HOST2 — SoC R1/R2; GPIO4_C2 (AF8) controls VBUS switch" (at 60 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"))
(text "USB2 HOST3 — SoC T1/T2; GPIO4_D2 (AB9) controls VBUS switch" (at 350 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"))
(text "Data path: RK3568 DP/DM → 2.2Ω series resistors → ESD5341N at connector → Type-A. Route as 90Ω differential pair, matched length; keep ESD close to connector." (at 60 285 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"))
(text "VBUS: TPS2553DBVR, RILIM=47kΩ. Datasheet tolerance gives an approximate 0.505–0.616A current-limit range; budget 0.62A per port. 100uF polymer + 100nF at each connector." (at 60 305 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004"))
(text "TPS2553 EN is active-high. 100kΩ pulldown keeps each port off during reset; Linux regulator GPIO enables the port. USB3 SuperSpeed contacts are NC: these two receptacles operate as USB2-only." (at 60 325 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005"))
